        <a href="tel:053-751-0071" class="btn-call-direct" style="background: #D9534F; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.94rem; text-decoration: none;">📞 1:1 전화 상담 예약 (053-751-0071)</a>
        <a href="/location/" class="btn-location-detail" style="background: #146369; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.94rem; text-decoration: none;">📍 범어역 오시는 길 상세</a>
